    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but stopping even for a second feels impossible. like as soon as i stop i'll just fall apart or everything will catch up to me. it's like there's no real way to get that peace you're talking about. it's just a constant cycle of trying and failing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
