      "content": "That feeling of impending collapse is the pressure cooker of being stuck, and it's exhausting just to fight it. You don't have to find \"peace\" in some grand, perfect moment; sometimes the only real relief is in the absolute, quiet surrender to the exhaustion. If the cycle is all you know, maybe the only way out is to break the pattern with something so small it feels like a complete failure to keep going.",
